      "value": "<h1>Benefits Enrollment Guide</h1><p>Step-by-step guide to October open enrollment for Bellmark employees, including DocuSign routing and plan comparisons. The employer share of the core medical plan is budgeted at 540 per employee per month.</p><ul><li>Owners</li><li>Key dates</li><li>Open questions</li></ul>",
