    "storage": {
      "value": "<h1>Compensation Bands</h1><p>Salary bands by level and department, reviewed annually by HR leadership. The approved 2026 band for HR Coordinator in Nashville is 52,000 to 60,000 with a midpoint target of 56,000.</p><ul><li>Owners</li><li>Key dates</li><li>Open questions</li></ul>",
      "representation": "storage"
